│ Expression:                                                                                                                                                            │
│ (len(list_filter(items, lambda x: (x = 'x7'))) > 0) AND (len(list_filter(items, lambda x: COALESCE(regexp_matches(x, '(?i)^(the\\s+)?company 1[0-9]\\b'), false))) <= 0) │
│ ~200 rows                                                                                                                                                              │
